
# Firmware

Firmware is **not yet included** in this repository.

Planned scope (target: STM32F411CEU6, programmed through the SWD header `J3`):

- Sample the TMP36 on `PA4` (ADC) with oversampling / averaging
- Convert the reading to °C (10 mV/°C, 500 mV offset)
- Map temperature to a PWM duty cycle on `PA6` (configurable temperature-to-speed curve)
- Optional: UART/LED status and over-temperature alarm
